% sourdough-ar.sty — Arabic edition layer for The Sourdough Framework
%
% Original: The Sourdough Framework by Hendrik Kleinwächter,
% the-sourdough-framework.com, CC BY-SA 4.0.
% The Arabic edition inherits CC BY-SA 4.0.
%
% This file is a fork of the upstream sourdough.sty carrying the RTL layer
% of the Arabic edition (Phase 28R reconstruction; the lost original is
% documented in the project record). Differences from upstream:
%   - microtype disabled (no Arabic-script support under LuaLaTeX)
%   - RTL layer: polyglossia (numerals=maghrib) loaded BEFORE luabidi
%   - Arabic font companions: Amiri body, Noto Naskh Arabic headings
%   - \arabicnumber patched with \@ensure@LTR wrap
%   - captions=nooneline
%   - TikZ LTR hook + node font override
%   - dotted numbers (sections, floats, chapters, TOC entries) wrapped LTR
%   - flowchart float with Arabic names
%   - \insert@column TRT patch for RTL table cells
%   - arabic-digits.lua post-filter loaded
%   - PDF metadata Title in Arabic
%
% STANDING RULES FOR THIS FILE:
%   - No \makeatletter here. A .sty already has @ as a letter; adding it
%     would BREAK every @-macro below (the Phase 21 regression).
%   - Do not modify this file without prior authorization.

